    "body": "This may also apply to URL paths produced by the URL parser when serialized paths are empty. For example, the paths of the following URLs are not equal: .\nURL | path\n-|-\n`non-spec:` | empty string\n`non-spec://h` | empty list\n\nSo maybe some examples can be added here?",
